  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Filling the gap - finally adressing Post TB disability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to secure the rights and needs of people with post TB disability, in Malawi, in Sudan and in Tanzania. Many people that have survived tuberculosis (TB), experience poor health, continued lung impairments, activity limitations and participation restrictions. Poor mental health is also prevalent. The project will adress life after TB.</narrative>
  </description>
